                                                   rdfs:subClassOf <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001334> ;
                                                   rdfs:label "Act of Remuneration"@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Act of Purchasing wherein a Financial Instrument is used by an Agent (the Employer) to compensate another Agent (the Employee) for the services they perform for the Employer."@en ;
                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Comment: Remuneration normally consists of salary or hourly wages, but also applies to commission, stock options, fringe benefits, etc."@en ;
